        "html": "<h3 id=\"light-sources\">Light sources</h3>\n<p>Who&#x27;s carrying them? What are their tags?</p>\n<p>How far can they see? What out in the dark can see them? How long will their light sources last, and is that long enough?</p>",
        "kind": "section"
