        "html": "<h3 id=\"equipment\">Equipment</h3>\n<p>What does everyone have in hand, or at the ready? How heavy a load are they carrying? If it&#x27;s a heavy load, how much does that suck? Do they have room to swing that <em>awkward</em> maul in here? Can they fit through that tunnel with their shield?</p>",
