        "html": "<h3 id=\"rolling\">Rolling</h3>\n<p>Each season indicates who rolls for the move (whoever is most hopeful rolls in spring, whoever is most content rolls in summer, etc.). &quot;Whoever&quot; refers to the PC, not the player. If you really can&#x27;t decide, pick randomly.</p>\n<p>Whoever rolls also makes any choices required by the move. They can ask for input, but the final decisions are theirs.</p>\n<p>Each season involves rolling +Fortunes, which results in some combination of seasonal gains, threats, and (in winter) the need to consume additional Surplus. More on that later.</p>\n<p>After the roll, reset Fortunes to +1 (or +0 if the village is currently <em>malcontent</em>).</p>",
        "kind": "section"
