        "html": "<h3 id=\"discoveries\">Discoveries</h3>\n<p>Pick 1 or have someone roll the Die of Fate.</p>\n<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"discovery\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d6\" title=\"Click to roll 1d6 — Shift: advantage · Ctrl: disadvantage\">1d6</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">Discovery</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1</th><td>signs of violence/disaster (below)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">2</th><td>A chance for insight into a threat or danger (e.g. tracks that reveal numbers, whereabouts, etc.)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3</th><td>A mine, abandoned or destroyed (perhaps mysteriously)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">4</th><td>Possessions/gear, lost or discarded</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">5</th><td>A vein of copper, hematite (iron ore), or galena (silver/lead ore)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6</th><td>A ruin or artifact of the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"forge-lords.html\" data-slug=\"forge-lords\" >Forge Lords</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"signs-of-violence-disaster\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d6\" title=\"Click to roll 1d6 — Shift: advantage · Ctrl: disadvantage\">1d6</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">Signs of Violence/Disaster</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1</th><td>A scene of wanton carnage</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">2</th><td>A dead monster from <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-labyrinth.html#navigating-the-labyrinth\" data-slug=\"the-labyrinth\" data-fragment=\"navigating-the-labyrinth\" >the Labyrinth</a>, bloody trail leading off</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3</th><td>One or more dead bodies</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">4-5</th><td>A recent collapse, possibly with survivors</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6</th><td>Sounds of a fight, or a call for help</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
