        "html": "<h3 id=\"dangers-2\">Dangers</h3>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Utter darkness</li><li>Getting lost</li><li>Pockets of bad air: stale, poisonous, smoke- or dust-filled</li><li>Cave-ins, especially in more recent excavations</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#laborers\" data-slug=\"gordins-delve\" data-fragment=\"laborers\"><strong>Laborers</strong></a>, with something to hide or protect</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html#ghosts\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" data-fragment=\"ghosts\" ><strong>Ghosts</strong></a>, victims of cave-ins or previous violence</li><li>Traps or wards protecting <strong>Forge Lord</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"forge-lords.html\" data-slug=\"forge-lords\" >compounds</a></li><li>Monsters come up from <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-labyrinth.html\" data-slug=\"the-labyrinth\" ><strong>the Labyrinth</strong></a></li></ul>",
