        "html": "<h3 id=\"enigmatic-structures\">Enigmatic structures</h3>\n<p>For example:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Iron spires, like hollow rusted trees, placed in a line across the landscape</li><li>A black cube the size of a house; when lightning strikes, the earth lights up for miles with glowing lines that fade over the next few minutes</li><li>Stone plinths along a ridge line, some of them topped with 6-foot-tall sculptures, like tulips, spinning in the breeze</li><li>Copper cylinders, each maybe 8 feet tall and caked in verdigris; mostly buried in white and chalky soil</li><li>Megaliths, etched with ideographs that describe the motions of the stars</li><li>A bronze plaque upon a stone slab, the only notable feature for miles; untouched by lichen; deeply etched ideographs begin with the phrase, &quot;This is not a place of honor&quot;</li></ul>\n<hr>",
